usage: csvgrep [flags] PATTERN FILE...

Prints the rows of CSV files in which a field matches PATTERN, a regular expression,
after the header row.

flags:
  -c, --column string      search only this column
  -s, --select list        print only this column (repeatable)
  -i, --ignore-case        match upper and lower case alike
  -n, --count              print the number of matching rows instead
  -d, --delimiter string   the field separator (default ",")
  -v, --verbose            trace what is read on stderr
  -h, --help               show this help and exit
